{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20979","headline":"章和二年中 · 李贺","name":"章和二年中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云萧索，田风拂拂，麦芒如篲黍如粟。\n关中父老百领襦，关东吏人乏诟租。\n健犊春耕土膏黑，菖蒲丛丛沿水脉。\n殷勤爲我下田租，百钱携偿丝桐客。\n游春漫光坞花白，野林散香神降席。\n拜神得寿献天子，七星贯断姮娥死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}